// Localised injuries. Severity runs 0..1 per wound.
// bleed: share of the blood volume lost per hour at severity 1 while the wound is not dressed.
// pain: pain at severity 1.   heal_days: days to mend from severity 1 for a healthy, fed, rested
// person without care.   infect: chance per day that an untreated open wound gets infected.
// internal: invisible without a medic (skill 3+) or an infirmary.   dress: needs a dressing,
// splint or suture (first aid) to heal properly; undressed it mends slowly and may leave a
// permanent disability.   parts: where it can strike (empty = anywhere).   cause: what makes it
// (for the codex).
